# Design System Guidelines

## Color Palette

### Primary Colors
```css
--color-primary: #2563eb;       /* blue-600 - Main actions */
--color-primary-hover: #1d4ed8; /* blue-700 - Hover state */
--color-primary-light: #dbeafe; /* blue-100 - Backgrounds */
```

### Status Colors
```css
--color-success: #10b981;    /* emerald-500 - Success states */
--color-warning: #f59e0b;    /* amber-500 - Warning states */
--color-danger: #ef4444;     /* red-500 - Error/danger states */
--color-info: #3b82f6;       /* blue-500 - Info states */
```

### Tank Status Colors
```css
--tank-full: #10b981;     /* emerald-500 - >= 80% */
--tank-normal: #3b82f6;   /* blue-500 - 30-80% */
--tank-low: #f59e0b;      /* amber-500 - 10-30% */
--tank-critical: #ef4444; /* red-500 - < 10% */
--tank-empty: #6b7280;    /* gray-500 - < 5 bar */
```

### Neutral Colors
```css
--color-background: #f9fafb;  /* gray-50 */
--color-surface: #ffffff;     /* white */
--color-border: #e5e7eb;      /* gray-200 */
--color-text: #111827;        /* gray-900 */
--color-text-muted: #6b7280;  /* gray-500 */
```

## Typography

### Font Family
```css
font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif;
```

### Font Sizes
| Name | Size | Line Height | Usage |
|------|------|-------------|-------|
| xs | 0.75rem | 1rem | Labels, captions |
| sm | 0.875rem | 1.25rem | Secondary text |
| base | 1rem | 1.5rem | Body text |
| lg | 1.125rem | 1.75rem | Subheadings |
| xl | 1.25rem | 1.75rem | Section titles |
| 2xl | 1.5rem | 2rem | Page titles |

## Spacing Scale

```css
--space-1: 0.25rem;  /* 4px */
--space-2: 0.5rem;   /* 8px */
--space-3: 0.75rem;  /* 12px */
--space-4: 1rem;     /* 16px */
--space-5: 1.25rem;  /* 20px */
--space-6: 1.5rem;   /* 24px */
--space-8: 2rem;     /* 32px */
```

## Border Radius

```css
--radius-sm: 0.25rem;  /* 4px - Buttons, inputs */
--radius-md: 0.375rem; /* 6px - Cards, modals */
--radius-lg: 0.5rem;   /* 8px - Larger containers */
--radius-full: 9999px; /* Pills, avatars */
```

## Shadows

```css
--shadow-sm: 0 1px 2px 0 rgb(0 0 0 / 0.05);
--shadow-md: 0 4px 6px -1px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.1);
--shadow-lg: 0 10px 15px -3px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.1);
```

## Component Variants

### Button Variants
- `primary`: Blue background, white text
- `secondary`: Gray background, dark text
- `danger`: Red background, white text
- `outline`: Border only, no background
- `ghost`: No background, no border

### Button Sizes
- `sm`: h-8, text-sm, px-3
- `md`: h-10, text-base, px-4
- `lg`: h-12, text-lg, px-6

### Input States
- Default: gray border
- Focus: blue border + ring
- Error: red border
- Disabled: gray background
